  - `Scripts/UI/`: `vr_menu_panel.gd`, `vr_menu_presenter.gd`, `round_hud.gd` (bracer panel)
  - `Scripts/XR/`: `xr_lifecycle_controller.gd`
  - `Scripts/Debug/`: `performance_monitor.gd`, `art_capture.gd`, `play_capture.gd`, `menu_capture.gd`, `menu_preview.gd`
- **[Scenes/](mdc:Scenes/)**: `Phantoms/` (base and four variants), `Player/`, `Rifts/`, `UI/`, `Debug/`
- **[Resources/Materials/](mdc:Resources/Materials/)**: creature, rift, lane, city, damage shaders and materials
- **[Assets/](mdc:Assets/)**: `Audio/Music/`, `Audio/SFX/` (takes picked by stem), `Audio/VO/chen/`
- **[Tests/](mdc:Tests/)**: `validation_runner.gd`, run by `tools/validate_project.sh` and GitHub Actions
